OL,3,GNEWSASon honours father killed in 9/11
OL,4,Aattacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Coventry is remembering his
OL,7,Ffather who was killed in the 9/11
OL,8,Fterrorist attacks on the United States.
OL,10,FRob Halligan's father, Bob, was working
OL,11,Fon the 99th floor of Two World Trade
OL,12,FCenter, the south block, when the
OL,13,Fbuilding was struck by a hijacked
OL,14,Fpassenger plane on 11 September 2001.
OL,16,FNearly 3,000 people died in the
OL,17,Fattacks, including 67 Britons, after
OL,18,Ffour passenger aircraft were hijacked
OL,19,Fby Al-Qaeda terrorists. Two of the
OL,20,Fplanes were flown into the Twin Towers.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
