OL,3,GNEWSASon honours father killed in 9/11
OL,4,Aattacks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It took a long time to find out if dad
OL,7,Fwas in there or not. You hold on to
OL,8,Fhope when you don't hear anything, but
OL,9,Fafter a couple of days you start to
OL,10,Fthink, 'I don't think he's got out',"
OL,11,FRob said.
